"Mina Nowak is a Sway, almost sixteen, thin with pale eyes, who stowed away on the SAL boat."
"She ran away in a tantrum, and learned mental targeting to impress hero schools."
"Her mental shout, Relax, damn you, reached Tuyet's Sway brother miles away."
"She activated Fragile Atmosphere, a silver-glitter skin layer, when the boat was hijacked."
"She was the boat's lone survivor, saved because her Fragile Atmosphere beat Contract standard."
"Her Sway parents pressured her; her family says she has no SAL ties, only class regret."
"She is cooperating with Artonan and Anesidoran authorities."
